#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21183
msgid "Blog"
msgstr "Blog"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21185
msgid "Use these variables to insert blog related information."
msgstr "Gebruik deze variabelen om bloggerelateerde informatie in te voegen."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21193
msgid ""
"Returns the <strong>WordPress Address (URL)</strong> setting in "
"<strong>WordPress Settings &gt; General</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Geeft de instelling <strong>WordPress-adres (URL)</strong> terug in "
"<strong>WordPress-instellingen &gt; Algemeen</strong>."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21201
msgid ""
"Returns the <strong>Site Title</strong> setting in <strong>WordPress "
"Settings &gt; General</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Geeft de instelling <strong>Sitetitel</strong> terug in <strong>WordPress-"
"instellingen &gt; Algemeen</strong>."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21208
msgid "Language (Site)"
msgstr "Taal (site)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21210
msgid ""
"Returns the Site Language from WordPress Settings &gt; General via "
"get_bloginfo( 'language' ). WordPress stores this using ISO 639 (with "
"optional ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 region when present; RFC 5646 formatting such as "
"en-US). May differ from #blog_locale (get_locale()) on some installs or with "
"multilingual plugins."
msgstr ""
"Retourneert de sitetaal uit WordPress-instellingen &gt; Algemeen via "
"get_bloginfo( 'language' ). WordPress slaat dit op met ISO 639 (met "
"optionele ISO 3166-1 alpha-2-regio indien aanwezig; RFC 5646-opmaak zoals en-"
"US). Kan op sommige installaties of met meertalige plugins afwijken van "
"#blog_locale (get_locale())."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21217
msgid "Locale (Site)"
msgstr "Locale (site)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21219
msgid ""
"POSIX-style locale identifier from <code>get_locale()</code>: language and "
"optional region separated by an underscore, as WordPress uses for "
"translations (similar to POSIX / C locale naming; for example <code>en_US</"
"code>, <code>fr_FR</code>, or <code>es</code>). When a region is present it "
"follows ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 (uppercase). Respects multilingual plugins that "
"filter the WordPress locale."
msgstr ""
"POSIX-stijl locale-id uit <code>get_locale()</code>: taal en optionele regio "
"gescheiden door een underscore, zoals WordPress gebruikt voor vertalingen "
"(vergelijkbaar met POSIX / C-locale-benaming; bijvoorbeeld <code>en_US</"
"code>, <code>fr_FR</code> of <code>es</code>). Wanneer een regio aanwezig "
"is, volgt deze ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 (hoofdletters). Houdt rekening met "
"meertalige plugins die de WordPress-locale filteren."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21225
msgid "Language Code (Site)"
msgstr "Taalcode (site)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21227
msgid ""
"Primary language subtag from the site locale in ISO 639-1 format (e.g. "
"<code>en</code>, <code>fr</code>, or <code>pt</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Primaire taalsubtag uit de sitelocale in ISO 639-1-indeling (bijv. <code>en</"
"code>, <code>fr</code> of <code>pt</code>)."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21233
msgid "Country Code (Site)"
msgstr "Landcode (site)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21235
msgid ""
"Region subtag from the site locale in ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 format (e.g. "
"<code>US</code>, <code>CA</code>), or blank if the locale has no region."
msgstr ""
"Regiosubtag uit de sitelocale in ISO 3166-1 alpha-2-indeling (bijv. "
"<code>US</code>, <code>CA</code>), of leeg als de locale geen regio heeft."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21243
msgid "Returns the site character set."
msgstr "Retourneert de tekenset van de site."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21249
msgid "Admin Email"
msgstr "Beheerder E-mail"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21250
msgid ""
"Returns the <strong>Administrator Email Address</strong> setting in "
"<strong>WordPress Settings &gt; General</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Geeft de instelling <strong>E-mailadres van beheerder</strong> terug in "
"<strong>WordPress-instellingen &gt; Algemeen</strong>."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21257
#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21330
#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21369
msgid "Current Time"
msgstr "Huidige tijd"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21259
msgid ""
"Returns the blog time formatted according to the <strong>Date Format</"
"strong> setting found in <strong>WordPress Settings &gt; General</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Geeft de blogtijd terug, opgemaakt volgens de instelling "
"<strong>Datumnotatie</strong> in <strong>WordPress-instellingen &gt; "
"Algemeen</strong>."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21267
#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21338
#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21379
msgid "Custom Date"
msgstr "Aangepaste Datum"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21274
msgid ""
"Returns the blog date and time in the specified format (PHP date format)."
msgstr ""
"Geeft de blogdatum en -tijd terug in de opgegeven indeling (PHP-"
"datumnotatie)."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21282
#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21352
#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21395
msgid "Current Date"
msgstr "Huidige datum"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21284
msgid ""
"Returns the blog time formatted according to the <strong>Time Format</"
"strong> setting found in <strong>WordPress Settings &gt; General</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Geeft de blogtijd terug, opgemaakt volgens de instelling "
"<strong>Tijdnotatie</strong> in <strong>WordPress-instellingen &gt; "
"Algemeen</strong>."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21295
msgid "Client"
msgstr "Klant"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21302
msgid "Language (Browser)"
msgstr "Taal (browser)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21303
msgid ""
"Language tag from the visitor's browser <code>navigator.language</code> (RFC "
"5646; ISO 639 with optional ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 region; hyphen-separated; for "
"example <code>en-US</code>). Client-side only; empty when parsed on the "
"server."
msgstr ""
"Taaltag uit de browser van de bezoeker <code>navigator.language</code> (RFC "
"5646; ISO 639 met optionele ISO 3166-1 alpha-2-regio; met koppeltekens "
"gescheiden; bijvoorbeeld <code>en-US</code>). Alleen client-side; leeg "
"wanneer op de server geparseerd."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21309
msgid "Locale (Browser)"
msgstr "Locale (browser)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21310
msgid ""
"POSIX-style locale derived from the browser tag: underscores instead of "
"hyphens (WordPress/POSIX-style; for example <code>en_US</code>). Region uses "
"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 when present. Client-side only; empty when parsed on the "
"server."
msgstr ""
"POSIX-stijl locale afgeleid van de browsertag: underscores in plaats van "
"koppeltekens (WordPress/POSIX-stijl; bijvoorbeeld <code>en_US</code>). Regio "
"gebruikt ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 indien aanwezig. Alleen client-side; leeg "
"wanneer op de server geparseerd."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21316
msgid "Language Code (Browser)"
msgstr "Taalcode (browser)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21317
msgid ""
"Primary language subtag from the browser locale (ISO 639; lowercase, "
"typically ISO 639-1). Client-side only; empty when parsed on the server."
msgstr ""
"Primaire taal-subtag uit de browserlocale (ISO 639; kleine letters, "
"doorgaans ISO 639-1). Alleen client-side; leeg wanneer op de server "
"geparseerd."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21323
msgid "Country Code (Browser)"
msgstr "Landcode (browser)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21324
msgid ""
"Region subtag from the browser locale using ISO 3166-1 alpha-2, or blank if "
"none. Client-side only; empty when parsed on the server."
msgstr ""
"Regiosubtag uit de browserlocale volgens ISO 3166-1 alpha-2, of leeg als er "
"geen is. Alleen client-side; leeg wanneer geparseerd op de server."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21331
msgid ""
"Returns the users web browser local time according to the <strong>Time "
